Hi {Owner},

I build admissions websites and portals for private schools and academies around {City}. {Business Name} looks wonderful in its posts, but the application is a PDF and the fees sit behind a prospectus request.

I built a sample rather than ask for a meeting first: an admissions timeline, open morning booking, a page per age phase, fees with scholarships and bursaries, bus routes and an online application that saves and resumes, with marked placeholders where your photos would go. It feeds your school management system:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, the build runs {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, admissions dates and updates. If not, no problem, the sample comes down at the end of the month.

Would thirty minutes with you and the head be worthwhile before the next open morning?

